    "catch_forecast_audit_each_configuration": "1 case, 7 assertions",
    "reference": "Five inputs covering Reject, Hold, Periodic, two nodes, nonuniform times, scalar/vector, and a 2^-200 value difference. The actual plan after building coefficients stays within the forecast for bits, payload and work, with the same slots. Source knots and values match independent Boost cpp_rational values at tolerance 0.",
    "work": "Bound includes the two standalone call reservations and both extra forecast passes made by the bridge. Equal cap admitted; one-less aggregate cap refused even when both local caps fit. Forecast and rejection allocate zero times. Original input bit cap still applies to boundary endpoints and period.",
    "mutation": "Byte-identical control and a version predicting one-bit coefficients compiled and linked in isolation with MSVC Debug. Control 127 assertions passed. Mutation Catch exit 42 (100 assertions passed, 8 failed), including nonuniform Hold boundary needing 203 rather than 9 integer bits and 2760 rather than 1464 payload bytes.",
